/*
  Grosse komplexe Stadt "Kronenburg" mit:
  - 5 Districts (Royal, Temple, Merchant, Craftsmen, Residential)
  - Umgebende Biome: Plains, Forest, Mountains
  - 6 Roads: Hauptstrassen und Handelswege
  - 2 Village-Points als Aussenposten
  - 1 River durch die Stadt

  Layout:
                     northern-forest
                          |
                     north-gate (Point)
                          |
         farmlands --- KRONENBURG --- east-hills
              |        (5 Districts)      |
         west-village                 east-village
              |                           |
         south-gate (Point) --- trade-crossroads (Point)
              |                           |
         southern-plains            mountain-pass (Point)
                                          |
                                    eastern-mountains

  Roads (7 total):
  ┌────────────────────┬──────────────────┬──────────────────┬───────────────┬───────┐
  │       Road         │       Von        │       Nach       │   Waypoint    │ Type  │
  ├────────────────────┼──────────────────┼──────────────────┼───────────────┼───────┤
  │ north-highway      │ north-gate       │ kronenburg-n     │ -             │highway│
  ├────────────────────┼──────────────────┼──────────────────┼───────────────┼───────┤
  │ west-trade-road    │ west-village     │ kronenburg-w     │ -             │street │
  ├────────────────────┼──────────────────┼──────────────────┼───────────────┼───────┤
  │ east-trade-road    │ kronenburg-e     │ east-village     │ -             │street │
  ├────────────────────┼──────────────────┼──────────────────┼───────────────┼───────┤
  │ south-highway      │ kronenburg-s     │ trade-crossroads │ south-gate    │highway│
  ├────────────────────┼──────────────────┼──────────────────┼───────────────┼───────┤
  │ mountain-trail     │ trade-crossroads │ mountain-pass    │ -             │path   │
  ├────────────────────┼──────────────────┼──────────────────┼───────────────┼───────┤
  │ western-loop       │ trade-crossroads │ west-village     │ -             │street │
  ├────────────────────┼──────────────────┼──────────────────┼───────────────┼───────┤
  │ highland-path      │ mountain-pass    │ east-village     │ -             │path   │
  └────────────────────┴──────────────────┴──────────────────┴───────────────┴───────┘

  Kreuzungen:
  - kronenburg: 4 Roads treffen sich (north, west, east, south) -> auto-plaza
  - trade-crossroads: 3 Roads treffen sich (south-highway, mountain-trail, western-loop) -> auto-plaza
  - west-village: 2 Roads (west-trade-road, western-loop)
  - east-village: 2 Roads (east-trade-road, highland-path)
  - mountain-pass: 2 Roads (mountain-trail, highland-path)
*/
